.Dd June 12, 2026
.Dt WAYLAND-SYSTEM 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm wayland-system
.Nd install the WAYLAND_SYSTEM desktop profile
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm install.sh
.Op Ar module
.Op Ar option ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
installs a separate Wayland desktop profile for Void Linux. It installs package
manifests and links repo-owned files from
.Pa .config ,
.Pa .local/bin ,
and
.Pa .local/share
into the target home directory.
.Pp
The profile targets Sway config, but keeps the X11 DoomWM stack outside this
repo.
.Sh MODULES
.Bl -tag -width "--system"
.It Fl -system
Install Void Wayland support packages.
.It Fl -dots
Install Wayland dotfile symlinks.
.It Fl -all
Install every module.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--dotfiles-prefix DIR"
.It Fl y , Fl -yes
Run non-interactively.
.It Fl -dry-run
Print planned actions without changing the system.
.It Fl -list
List modules and exit.
.It Fl -uninstall
Uninstall selected dotfile symlinks.
.It Fl -no-deps
Skip package installation.
.It Fl -optional
Include optional packages from
.Pa packages/void/90-optional .
.It Fl -packages-dir Ar DIR
Read Void package manifests from
.Ar DIR .
.It Fl -dotfiles-prefix Ar DIR
Install dotfile symlinks under
.Ar DIR .
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Dl \&./install.sh --dry-run --all
.Dl \&./install.sh --yes --dots --no-deps
.Dl \&./install.sh --uninstall --dots
